<title>NETHERLANDS: CONTENT 1996 PROFIT 17.8 MILLION GUILDERS.</title>
<headline>CONTENT 1996 PROFIT 17.8 MILLION GUILDERS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>96 to Dec 31</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     3.27 vs   2.67</p>
<p>    Net profit			     17.8 vs  14.5</p>
<p>    Turnover				 381  vs  317</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Content Beheer NV.</p>
<p>Temporary employment agency Content said it would publish</p>
<p>full 1996 figures and a dividend proposal on March 14.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
